## Business Immigration
URL: https://alanfaldoc.com/services/business-immigration
Author: Al Anfal Doc Team. Last updated: 2026-11-05.

**Quick answer:** Business immigration covers residence routes for company owners, investors and skilled professionals in the UAE, including the golden visa and residence linked to a company licence. Eligibility depends on the category and on current rules, so documents should be prepared and checked carefully before applying.

Key takeaways:
- Golden visa, investor and company-owner residence are the main routes
- Eligibility depends on category and current rules
- Family members can usually be sponsored by eligible residents
- Careful document preparation reduces delays

At a glance:
