- Family: Eligible residents can usually sponsor family members

FAQs:
Q: What is the UAE golden visa?
A: A long-term residence visa for eligible investors, entrepreneurs and skilled professionals. Eligibility depends on the category and current rules.
Q: Can I get residence as a company owner?
A: Yes, owners and partners of a UAE company can usually apply for residence linked to the company. Requirements depend on the licence type.
Q: Can my family be included?
A: Eligible residents can generally sponsor family members. We prepare the documentation for each sponsored person.

