# Articles

## Mainland vs Free Zone: Which Is Right for Your Business?
URL: https://alanfaldoc.com/blog/mainland-vs-free-zone
Author: Al Anfal Doc Team. Last updated: 2026-10-28.

**Quick answer:** A mainland licence lets you trade across the UAE and with government entities, while a free zone licence offers a simpler setup and full foreign ownership within the zone. The right choice depends on where your customers are, the activity you need and your budget.

Key takeaways:
- Mainland: trade anywhere in the UAE and bid for government contracts
- Free zone: faster setup, often 100% foreign ownership inside the zone
- Office requirements differ between the two
- Choose based on customers, activity and budget

At a glance:
- Mainland: Trade across the UAE, work with government, office usually required
- Free zone: Simple incorporation, often 100% ownership, trading outside the zone usually needs a distributor
- Best when: Mainland: UAE-wide customers. Free zone: international or zone-based business

Sources:
- UAE Government Portal (u.ae): https://u.ae/en

