A: Send us the updated details through the contact page or by email and we will update your file.

## Company Formation

Q: Can I own 100% of my company?

A: In most activities, yes. We confirm eligibility for your activity and jurisdiction first.

Q: Mainland or free zone, which is better?

A: It depends on where your customers are and what you need to trade. We compare both against your plan.

Q: How long does it take to get a trade licence?

A: It varies by jurisdiction and activity. We give you a realistic timeline after reviewing your file.

